      ],
      "source": "https://2354project.org/brown-family/",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1947, Hattie signed a lawsuit against the Pulaski County School Board seeking equal education for her children.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://2354project.org/brown-family/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Descendants recall Allisonia as a close‑knit, welcoming community where families took pride in the land they owned.",
